stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INTAKE

    INTAKE: 1. INTAKE (confirm outline)
    DRAFT_PLAN: 2. DRAFT_PLAN (spec + plan + strategy)
    PLAN_REVIEW: 3. PLAN_REVIEW (signed review preset + audit)
    APPROVED: 4. APPROVED (Gate 1 SSH signature)
    IN_WORKTREE: 5. IN_WORKTREE (build & test)
    WORKTREE_REVIEW: 6. WORKTREE_REVIEW (signed code-review preset + audit)
    VERIFY_EXIT: 7. VERIFY_EXIT (Gate 3 SSH signature + retrospective)
    DONE: 8. DONE (signed closure)

    INTAKE --> DRAFT_PLAN
    DRAFT_PLAN --> PLAN_REVIEW
    PLAN_REVIEW --> APPROVED
    APPROVED --> IN_WORKTREE
    IN_WORKTREE --> WORKTREE_REVIEW
